; SMB 3.1.1 on the Amiga: crypto speed, then a guest mount of the Drobo
FailAt 21
Echo "start" >DH0:PrismNet/smb3.log
DH0:PrismNet/hashbench >>DH0:PrismNet/smb3.log
Copy DH0:PrismNet/cfg/dhcp ENV:PrismNet ALL QUIET
C:PrismNet START
Wait 6
Mount DH0:PrismNet/smb/PS0
List "PS0:amiga dump" >>DH0:PrismNet/smb3.log
Date >>DH0:PrismNet/smb3.log
Copy "PS0:amiga dump/A4000.47.115.rom" DH0:PrismNet/rom3 >>DH0:PrismNet/smb3.log
Date >>DH0:PrismNet/smb3.log
Echo "DONE" >>DH0:PrismNet/smb3.log